{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Leaf heads in the direction of the pub, but stops short at the door. Somehow she thought being in the New World would make this feeling different, but the insecurities still prickle up her back. Maybe tomorrow. Besides, who wants to be inside after being stuck in that sub for so long? For now, Leaf settles for a tree not far from the pub. Her experience finding places to listen but not be seen still holds up, as well as her love for trees. She curls up underneath it and finds that the familiar feeling brings her to sleep faster than any bed could. As she drifts off, she pleads with herself and Melora ||*They're not gone, just lost. Just like you.*||","created_at":"2020-08-01T09:18:07.261000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-01T09:18:45.357000Z","id":"739049313711423528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
